[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11590.19, "timestamp": "03:13:10", "text": "呃，我們需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11597.67, "timestamp": "03:13:17", "text": "製作一塊木頭。我不想毀掉它。所以，讓我們去向聖主祈禱吧。那是一個洞穴洞口。哇"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11602.79, "timestamp": "03:13:22", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11608.91, "timestamp": "03:13:28", "text": "我想像一下死在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11612.75, "timestamp": "03:13:32", "text": "那裡的情景。  種類。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11627.59, "timestamp": "03:13:47", "text": "等等，船要怎麼造？等等，造船要怎麼造來著？"}]